13750,1,"Configuration stored in registry is corrupted, so it cannot be loaded. Open Samandarin was probably terminated during saving configuration. This happens mainly when Open Samandarin is still running when you shutdown system (or log off). To prevent this problem, close Open Samandarin before shutdown (or log off).\n\nYou can backup corrupted configuration now (run RegEdit.exe, rename key HKEY_CURRENT_USER\\%s). Later you can try to get some settings from this backup (User Menu, Hotpaths, FTP bookmarks, etc.), visit forum.altap.cz for details.\n\nCorrupted configuration must be removed from registry before starting Open Samandarin."
13751,1,"您在登出和關閉期間使用的下列參數設定了非標準值。這可能導致 Open Samandarin 設定損毀（設定儲存期間遭終止）。\n\nHKEY_CURRENT_USER\\Control Panel\\Desktop\\WaitToKillAppTimeout 應為 20000。\nHKEY_CURRENT_USER\\Control Panel\\Desktop\\AutoEndTasks 應為 0。"
